<template>
  <section class="production-dashboard">
    <header class="production-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRODUCTION OVERVIEW</p><h1>项目运行看板</h1><p>看清每一集的执行状态，从异常直接回到原始记录。</p></div><div class="production-heading-actions"><select :value="dramaId||''" aria-label="看板项目" @change="$emit('project',Number($event.target.value)||null)"><option value="">{{ isAdmin?'全部项目':'我的项目' }}</option><option v-for="project in dashboard?.projects||[]" :key="project.id" :value="project.id">{{ project.title }}</option></select><button class="btn" :disabled="loading" @click="load"><RefreshCw :size="13" :class="{'animate-spin':loading}" />刷新</button><NuxtLink v-if="dramaId" class="btn btn-primary" :to="'/drama/'+dramaId">选择剧集批量处理<ArrowUpRight :size="13" /></NuxtLink></div></header>
    <p v-if="error" class="production-error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p>
    <div v-if="dashboard?.batch_exceptions?.length" class="batch-exception-notice"><CircleAlert :size="15" /><span>{{ dashboard.batch_exceptions_total ?? dashboard.batch_exceptions.length }} 个批次步骤需关注</span><template v-for="item in dashboard.batch_exceptions.slice(0,3)" :key="item.id"><NuxtLink v-if="/^\/production\?drama_id=\d+&batch_id=[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$/u.test(item.href||'')" :to="item.href">第 {{ item.episode_number }} 集 · {{ targetLabel(item.target) }} · {{ productionStatus(item.status) }}</NuxtLink></template><button v-if="dashboard.batch_exceptions_total>3" class="btn btn-sm" @click="exceptionsOnly=true">查看需关注剧集</button></div>
    <p v-if="summary.batch_steps?.total" class="production-batch-overview">提取步骤：共 {{ summary.batch_steps.total }} 步 · 待派发 {{ summary.batch_steps.queued }} · 执行 {{ summary.batch_steps.running }} · 完成 {{ summary.batch_steps.completed }} · 失败 {{ summary.batch_steps.failed }} · 待核对 {{ summary.batch_steps.needs_review }}<template v-if="summary.batch_steps.input_stale"> · 输入变更 {{ summary.batch_steps.input_stale }}</template><template v-if="summary.batch_steps.blocked"> · 等待前序 {{ summary.batch_steps.blocked }}</template></p>
    <div class="production-metrics"><article><span>范围内剧集</span><strong>{{ summary.episodes_total ?? '—' }}</strong><small>{{ summary.episodes_unrecorded ?? '—' }} 集暂无运行记录</small></article><article class="active"><span>执行中的调用</span><strong>{{ summary.counts?.running ?? '—' }}</strong><small>已登记的实际执行任务</small></article><article><span>排队中的调用</span><strong>{{ summary.counts?.queued ?? '—' }}</strong><small>等待执行</small></article><article class="danger"><span>失败 / 中断记录</span><strong>{{ summary.counts ? Number(summary.counts.failed||0)+Number(summary.counts.interrupted||0) : '—' }}</strong><small>保留重试前的历史记录</small></article><article class="success"><span>成功调用记录</span><strong>{{ summary.counts?.completed ?? '—' }}</strong><small>含各次已完成的真实调用</small></article></div>
    <section class="batch-panel"><div class="batch-panel-heading"><div><h2>多集批量处理</h2><p>每集按 角色 → 场景 → 道具 → 出图 → 拆分镜 中所选的步骤依次处理，汇总后停止。暂停只停止新派发，已经执行的步骤继续。</p></div><select v-model="batchId" aria-label="选择提取批次"><option value="">选择批次查看回执</option><option v-for="batch in batches" :key="batch.id" :value="batch.id">{{ productionDate(batch.created_at) }} · {{ productionStatus(batch.status) }} · {{ batch.id.slice(0,8) }}</option></select></div><p v-if="batchError" class="production-error">{{ batchError }}</p><template v-if="batchDetail"><div class="batch-summary-row"><span :class="['state-pill',productionTone(batchDetail.status)]">{{ productionStatus(batchDetail.status) }}</span><span>{{ batchDetail.concurrency }} 集并行</span><span>待派发 {{ batchDetail.counts?.queued ?? 0 }}</span><span>执行 {{ batchDetail.counts?.running ?? 0 }}</span><span>完成 {{ batchDetail.counts?.completed ?? 0 }} / {{ batchDetail.counts?.total ?? batchDetail.steps?.length ?? 0 }} 步</span><span>失败 {{ batchDetail.counts?.failed ?? 0 }}</span><span>待核对 {{ batchDetail.counts?.needs_review ?? 0 }}</span><span v-if="batchDetail.counts?.input_stale">输入变更 {{ batchDetail.counts.input_stale }}</span><span v-if="batchDetail.counts?.blocked">等待前序 {{ batchDetail.counts.blocked }}</span><span v-if="batchDetail.counts?.reused">其中复用 {{ batchDetail.counts.reused }}</span><div class="batch-actions"><button v-if="batchDetail.status==='running'" class="btn btn-sm" :disabled="!!actionBusy" @click="batchAction('pause')">暂停派发</button><button v-if="batchDetail.status==='paused'" class="btn btn-sm" :disabled="!!actionBusy" @click="batchAction('resume')">继续派发</button><button v-if="retryableCount>0" class="btn btn-sm" :disabled="!!actionBusy" @click="batchAction('retry')">仅重试失败 / 输入变更 {{ retryableCount }} 步</button></div></div><p v-if="batchDetail.counts?.needs_review" class="review-note">有提交结果待核对的步骤。请先查看原任务，只观察，不会自动重新提交。</p><details class="batch-receipts"><summary>逐集步骤回执 · {{ batchDetail.steps?.length || 0 }} 项</summary><div class="batch-receipt-list"><button v-for="step in batchDetail.steps||[]" :key="step.id" @click="selectBatchStep(step)"><span>第 {{ episodeNumber(step.episode_id) }} 集 · {{ targetLabel(step.target) }}</span><span :class="['state-pill',productionTone(step.status)]">{{ productionStatus(step.status) }}</span><small>{{ receiptLabel(step) }}</small></button></div></details></template><p v-else class="batch-empty">在项目的剧集列表多选，创建批次后可以在这里暂停、继续和查看回执。</p></section>
    <div class="production-content"><main class="production-table-panel"><div class="production-table-toolbar"><div><h2>逐集运行状态</h2><p>步骤显示当前状态，重试前的调用记录会保留。</p></div><label><input v-model="exceptionsOnly" type="checkbox" />只看需关注</label></div><div v-if="dashboard?.exceptions?.length" class="exception-strip"><CircleAlert :size="14" /><span>{{ dashboard.exceptions_total ?? dashboard.exceptions.length }} 条调用异常记录（含历史）</span><button v-for="task in dashboard.exceptions.slice(0,3)" :key="task.id" @click="inspectTask(task.id)">{{ task.title }}<ChevronRight :size="12" /></button></div><div class="production-table-scroll"><table class="production-table"><thead><tr><th>剧集</th><th>各步骤状态</th><th>最后更新</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="episode in visibleEpisodes" :key="episode.id"><td><strong>第 {{ episode.episode_number }} 集</strong><span>{{ episode.title }}</span><small v-if="!dramaId">{{ projectTitle(episode.project_id) }}</small></td><td><div class="production-step-list"><button v-for="step in episode.steps||[]" :key="step.key" :class="['production-step',productionTone(step.status),{selected:selectedEpisode?.id===episode.id&&selectedStep?.key===step.key}]" :title="step.note || ''" @click="selectStep(episode,step)"><span>{{ step.label }}</span><strong>{{ productionStatus(step.status) }}</strong><small v-if="step.stale">长时间未更新</small></button></div></td><td><span>{{ productionDate(lastEpisodeUpdate(episode)) }}</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div v-if="!dashboard?.episodes?.length" class="production-empty"><Loader2 v-if="loading" class="animate-spin" :size="23" /><ListTodo v-else :size="28" /><h3>{{ loading?'正在读取运行记录':exceptionsOnly?'没有符合条件的异常剧集':'暂无剧集' }}</h3><p>有记录才显示已完成；暂无记录不会按资产数量推断。</p></div></div><footer class="production-table-footer"><span>{{ visibleEpisodes.length ? (offset+1)+'–'+(offset+visibleEpisodes.length) : '0' }} / {{ dashboard?.episodes?.length || 0 }} 集 · {{ dashboard?.generated_at ? '更新于 '+productionDate(dashboard.generated_at) : '等待服务端快照' }}</span><div><button class="btn btn-sm" :disabled="offset===0||loading" @click="offset=Math.max(0,offset-limit)">上一页</button><button class="btn btn-sm" :disabled="!dashboard?.tasks||offset+limit>=(dashboard.episodes?.length||0)||loading" @click="offset+=limit">下一页</button></div></footer></main>
      <aside class="production-inspector"><template v-if="selectedStep||task"><header><span class="eyebrow">EXECUTION DETAIL</span><h2>{{ selectedStep?.source==='preparation' ? selectedStep.label : task?.title || selectedStep?.label || targetLabel(selectedStep?.target) }}</h2><span :class="['state-pill',productionTone(selectedStep?.source==='preparation'?selectedStep.status:task?.status||selectedStep?.status)]">{{ productionStatus(selectedStep?.source==='preparation'?selectedStep.status:task?.status||selectedStep?.status) }}</span></header><p v-if="selectedStep?.note" class="review-note">{{ selectedStep.note }}</p><p v-if="taskLoading" class="inspector-note">正在读取原任务详情…</p><p v-if="taskError" class="production-error">{{ taskError }}</p><dl><div><dt>剧集</dt><dd>{{ selectedEpisode ? '第 '+selectedEpisode.episode_number+' 集' : '见原始任务记录' }}</dd></div><div v-if="task?.stage"><dt>当前阶段</dt><dd>{{ task.stage_label||task.stage }}</dd></div><div><dt>执行次数</dt><dd>{{ selectedStep?.attempt ?? '见原始记录' }}</dd></div><div><dt>耗时</dt><dd>{{ productionSeconds(selectedStep?.source==='preparation'?selectedStep.elapsed_seconds:task?.elapsed_seconds) }}</dd></div><div v-if="task?.stage_elapsed_seconds!=null"><dt>本阶段耗时</dt><dd>{{ productionSeconds(task.stage_elapsed_seconds) }}</dd></div><div v-if="task?.provider_http_status!=null"><dt>HTTP 状态</dt><dd>{{ task.provider_http_status }}</dd></div><div><dt>模型</dt><dd>{{ task?.model || batchDetail?.model || '未提供' }}</dd></div><div><dt>最后更新</dt><dd>{{ productionDate(task?.last_progress_at||selectedStep?.last_progress_at||selectedStep?.updated_at) }}</dd></div></dl><div v-if="selectedStep?.source==='preparation'?selectedStep.exception:task?.exception" class="inspector-exception"><strong>{{ (selectedStep?.source==='preparation'?selectedStep.exception:task.exception).label }}</strong><p>{{ (selectedStep?.source==='preparation'?selectedStep.exception:task.exception).summary }}</p><small v-if="(selectedStep?.source==='preparation'?selectedStep.exception:task.exception).submission_uncertain">提交结果待核对，只查看原任务，不会自动重发。</small></div><p v-else-if="selectedStep?.error||selectedStep?.error_message" class="production-error">{{ selectedStep.error||selectedStep.error_message }}</p><p v-if="(task?.stale||selectedStep?.stale)&&!task?.exception" class="review-note">长时间未更新。请查看实际日志，不能仅凭等待时间判断失败。</p><p v-if="selectedStep?.receipt?.ok" class="review-note">{{ receiptLabel(selectedStep) }}</p><div class="inspector-links"><NuxtLink v-if="relatedBatchHref" :to="relatedBatchHref" class="btn">打开所属批次</NuxtLink><NuxtLink v-if="logHref" :to="logHref" class="btn btn-primary"><Activity :size="13" />定位 AI 实况<ArrowUpRight :size="13" /></NuxtLink><NuxtLink v-if="assetHref" :to="assetHref" class="btn">查看关联资产<ArrowUpRight :size="13" /></NuxtLink><NuxtLink v-if="!assetHref&&selectedProjectId" :to="'/drama/'+selectedProjectId+'?tab=assets'" class="btn">打开项目资产库</NuxtLink><NuxtLink v-if="selectedProjectId" :to="'/drama/'+selectedProjectId" class="btn">打开项目</NuxtLink><NuxtLink v-if="settingsHref" :to="settingsHref" class="btn">检查模型配置</NuxtLink></div><p class="inspector-note">操作只针对明确选中的批次。原始日志、工具回执和真实结果可在 AI 实况查看。</p></template><div v-else class="inspector-empty"><Activity :size="27" /><h3>选择一个步骤</h3><p>查看执行状态与异常，再直接定位到原任务、资产或模型配置。</p></div></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</template>
<script setup>
import {computed,onBeforeUnmount,onMounted,ref,watch} from 'vue'
import {Activity,ArrowUpRight,RefreshCw,ChevronRight,CircleAlert,ListTodo,Loader2} from 'lucide-vue-next'
import {productionAPI} from '~/composables/useApi'
import {platformSession} from '~/utils/platform-session'
import {productionStatus,productionTone,productionSeconds,productionDate,activityLink,assetLink} from '~/utils/production-presentation.js'
const props=defineProps({dramaId:{type:[Number,String],default:null},initialBatchId:{type:String,default:''}});defineEmits(['project'])
const dashboard=ref(null),batches=ref([]),batchId=ref(props.initialBatchId),batchDetail=ref(null),loading=ref(false),error=ref(''),batchError=ref(''),actionBusy=ref(''),exceptionsOnly=ref(false),offset=ref(0),limit=60
const selectedEpisode=ref(null),selectedStep=ref(null),task=ref(null),taskLoading=ref(false),taskError=ref('')
const visibleEpisodes=computed(()=>(dashboard.value?.episodes||[]).slice(offset.value,offset.value+limit))
const isAdmin=computed(()=>platformSession.user?.role==='admin'),summary=computed(()=>dashboard.value?.summary||{}),retryableCount=computed(()=>Number(batchDetail.value?.counts?.failed||0)+Number(batchDetail.value?.counts?.input_stale||0))
const selectedProjectId=computed(()=>task.value?.project_id||task.value?.drama_id||selectedEpisode.value?.project_id||props.dramaId)
const linkedTask=computed(()=>task.value||((selectedStep.value?.activity_task_id||selectedStep.value?.latest_task_id)?{project_id:selectedProjectId.value,links:{activity:{task_id:selectedStep.value.activity_task_id||selectedStep.value.latest_task_id}}}:null))
const logHref=computed(()=>activityLink(linkedTask.value,selectedProjectId.value)),assetHref=computed(()=>assetLink(task.value,selectedProjectId.value))
const relatedBatchHref=computed(()=>selectedStep.value?.batch_id&&selectedProjectId.value?'/production?drama_id='+Number(selectedProjectId.value)+'&batch_id='+encodeURIComponent(selectedStep.value.batch_id):'')
const settingsHref=computed(()=>isAdmin.value&&Number(task.value?.links?.settings?.channel_id)>0&&Number(task.value?.links?.settings?.config_id)>0?'/admin/channels?'+(Number(task.value.links.settings.channel_id)>0?'channel_id='+Number(task.value.links.settings.channel_id)+'&':'')+'config_id='+Number(task.value.links.settings.config_id):'')
let alive=true,reading=null,sequence=0,taskSequence=0,batchSequence=0,timer=null,reloadAfterRead=false
const actorId=platformSession.user?.id,valid=()=>alive&&platformSession.user?.id===actorId
function targetLabel(value){return({characters:'角色提取',scenes:'场景提取',props:'道具提取',images:'出资产图',storyboard:'拆分镜'})[value]||'处理步骤'}
function receiptLabel(step){if(step.reused)return '已复用成功保存回执';const receipt=step.receipt;if(receipt?.ok)return `保存回执：新增 ${receipt.created}，合并 ${receipt.merged}，复用 ${receipt.reused}`
  const result=step.result
  if(result?.kind==='images')return `出图：可出图 ${result.total} 个，已有图 ${result.skipped_existing} 个，新出 ${result.generated} 张${result.failed?.length?`，未生成 ${result.failed.length} 张（${result.failed.slice(0,3).map(item=>item.name).join('、')}${result.failed.length>3?'等':''}）`:''}${result.running?'，进行中':''}`
  if(result?.kind==='storyboard')return result.skipped?(step.error||'本集已有分镜，未重拆'):`拆分镜：${result.completed??0}/${result.total??'?'} 组通过${step.error?'；'+step.error:''}`
  return step.error||step.error_message||''}
function projectTitle(id){return dashboard.value?.projects?.find(project=>Number(project.id)===Number(id))?.title||'项目 #'+id}
function episodeNumber(id){return dashboard.value?.episodes?.find(episode=>Number(episode.id)===Number(id))?.episode_number||id}
function lastEpisodeUpdate(episode){return episode.last_progress_at||(episode.steps||[]).map(step=>step.last_progress_at).filter(Boolean).sort().at(-1)}
function clearInspector(){++taskSequence;selectedEpisode.value=null;selectedStep.value=null;task.value=null;taskLoading.value=false;taskError.value=''}
function inspectTask(id){clearInspector();selectTask(id)}
function currentSelectionTaskId(){const step=selectedStep.value;if(step?.key){const episode=dashboard.value?.episodes?.find(item=>item.id===selectedEpisode.value?.id),fresh=episode?.steps?.find(item=>item.key===step.key);if(!fresh){clearInspector();return null}selectedEpisode.value=episode;selectedStep.value=fresh;return fresh.latest_task_id||null}if(step?.batch_id){const fresh=batchDetail.value?.steps?.find(item=>item.id===step.id);if(!fresh){clearInspector();return null}selectedStep.value=fresh;return fresh.activity_task_id||null}return task.value?.id||null}
async function loadBatch(){const id=batchId.value,version=++batchSequence;if(!id){batchDetail.value=null;batchError.value='';return}try{const value=await productionAPI.batch(id);if(valid()&&batchId.value===id&&version===batchSequence){if(props.dramaId&&Number(value.drama_id)!==Number(props.dramaId)){batchDetail.value=null;batchError.value='该批次不属于当前项目，请打开对应项目查看。';return}batchDetail.value=value;batchError.value=''}}catch(failure){if(valid()&&version===batchSequence)batchError.value=failure.message}}
async function load(){if(!valid())return;if(reading)return reading;const version=++sequence;loading.value=true;reading=(async()=>{try{const results=await Promise.allSettled([productionAPI.dashboard({project_id:props.dramaId,exceptions_only:exceptionsOnly.value?1:undefined,limit,offset:offset.value}),productionAPI.batches(props.dramaId?Number(props.dramaId):undefined)]);if(!valid()||version!==sequence)return;const failures=[];if(results[0].status==='fulfilled')dashboard.value=results[0].value;else failures.push(results[0].reason.message);if(results[1].status==='fulfilled')batches.value=results[1].value.batches||[];else failures.push(results[1].reason.message);error.value=failures.join('；');if(batchId.value)await loadBatch();const currentTaskId=currentSelectionTaskId();if(currentTaskId)await selectTask(currentTaskId);else if(selectedStep.value){++taskSequence;task.value=null;taskLoading.value=false}}finally{if(valid()&&version===sequence)loading.value=false;reading=null;if(reloadAfterRead&&valid()){reloadAfterRead=false;load()}}})();return reading}
function reload(){++sequence;if(reading){reloadAfterRead=true;return reading}return load()}
async function selectTask(id){const version=++taskSequence;taskLoading.value=true;taskError.value='';if(task.value?.id!==id)task.value=null;try{const value=await productionAPI.task(id);if(valid()&&version===taskSequence){task.value=value.task;if(value.task?.episode_id)selectedEpisode.value=dashboard.value?.episodes?.find(episode=>Number(episode.id)===Number(value.task.episode_id))||selectedEpisode.value}}catch(failure){if(valid()&&version===taskSequence)taskError.value=failure.message}finally{if(valid()&&version===taskSequence)taskLoading.value=false}}
function selectStep(episode,step){selectedEpisode.value=episode;selectedStep.value=step;task.value=null;++taskSequence;taskLoading.value=false;taskError.value='';if(step.latest_task_id)selectTask(step.latest_task_id)}
function selectBatchStep(step){selectedStep.value=step;selectedEpisode.value=dashboard.value?.episodes?.find(episode=>Number(episode.id)===Number(step.episode_id))||{id:step.episode_id,episode_number:step.episode_number||episodeNumber(step.episode_id),project_id:batchDetail.value?.drama_id};task.value=null;++taskSequence;taskLoading.value=false;taskError.value='';if(step.activity_task_id)selectTask(step.activity_task_id)}
async function batchAction(action){if(actionBusy.value||!batchId.value)return;if(action==='retry'&&!window.confirm('仅重新执行确定失败或输入已变更的步骤，可能消耗文字模型额度。待核对步骤不会重新提交。确认继续？'))return;const id=batchId.value;actionBusy.value=action;try{const value=await productionAPI[action](id);if(valid()&&batchId.value===id)batchDetail.value=value;await load()}catch(failure){if(valid())batchError.value=failure.message}finally{actionBusy.value=''}}
watch(batchId,loadBatch)
watch([exceptionsOnly,offset],([filter],[previous])=>{if(filter!==previous&&offset.value>0){offset.value=0;return}reload()})
watch(()=>props.initialBatchId,id=>{batchId.value=id||''})
watch(()=>props.dramaId,()=>{++taskSequence;dashboard.value=null;task.value=null;taskLoading.value=false;selectedStep.value=null;selectedEpisode.value=null;batchId.value=props.initialBatchId||'';batchDetail.value=null;offset.value=0;reload()})
onMounted(()=>{load();timer=setInterval(()=>{if(valid()&&document.visibilityState!=='hidden')load()},5000)})
onBeforeUnmount(()=>{alive=false;++sequence;++taskSequence;++batchSequence;clearInterval(timer)})
</script>
<style scoped>
.batch-exception-notice{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent-bg);color:var(--accent-text);font-size:11px;margin-bottom:18px}.batch-exception-notice a{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-2);padding:5px 7px;background:var(--bg-1);border-radius:5px;text-decoration:none}.production-batch-overview{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 12px}.production-error,.inspector-exception{overflow-wrap:anywhere}

.production-dashboard{padding:28px;max-width:1800px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto}.production-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--accent-text);font-weight:700}.production-heading h1{font-size:27px;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.production-heading p:last-child{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px}.production-heading-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.production-heading select,.batch-panel select{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-1);color:var(--text-2);padding:9px 12px;font-size:11px;max-width:250px}.production-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}.production-metrics article{padding:18px 20px;background:var(--bg-1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;display:grid;gap:10px}.production-metrics span{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3)}.production-metrics strong{font-size:29px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.04em}.production-metrics small{font-size:9px;color:var(--text-3)}.production-metrics .danger strong{color:var(--error)}.production-metrics .active strong{color:var(--accent-text)}.production-metrics .success strong{color:var(--success)}.batch-panel{background:var(--bg-1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:20px}.batch-panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}.batch-panel h2,.production-table-toolbar h2{font-size:13px;font-weight:650}.batch-panel-heading p,.production-table-toolbar p{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.8;margin-top:7px}.batch-summary-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-2)}.batch-actions{display:flex;gap:7px;margin-left:auto;flex-wrap:wrap}.state-pill{display